OL,3,GNEWSAWill a new code end 'rip-off
OL,4,Aparking charges'?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was completely on edge, every single
OL,7,Fday," said Rosey Greenwood. "I had
OL,8,Fletters coming through - I had debt
OL,9,Fcollectors after me."
OL,11,FTwo years ago, Rosey was being told to
OL,12,Fpay #1,906 because she had taken too
OL,13,Flong to pay for parking.
OL,15,FRosey had paid every single time she
OL,16,Fparked at the Copeland Street car park
OL,17,Fin Derby, and had bank records to prove
OL,18,Fit. But Rosey had unknowingly broken
OL,19,Fthe car park's terms and conditions,
OL,20,Fwhich stipulated that drivers must pay
OL,21,Fwithin five minutes of entering.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
